  "details": "I have heard people want the ability to change their in game status, blue, green, orange, red per list of friends they have set. (Lists are ways to categorize friends into groups, which is already in the game so lets make it more useful!)\n\nSay I have a list that is strictly for people that are party people, and a seperate list that are more cozy chill type people. I want to pick and choose who can join me. Granted this also adheres to if an instance is open or not, but id imagine its still quite useful for invite only instances.",
